    "storage": {
      "value": "<ac:structured-macro ac:macro-id=\"f1bde387-f115-4155-b245-b894d11993e1\" ac:name=\"warning\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:rich-text-body><p>Is this page needed? Shall we consider deleting it, and instead create a document which maps a Hospital workflow, with Bahmni features?</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><h2>Flow</h2><h3>Typical OPD patient flow</h3><p>registration</p><p>consultation with doctor/paramedic capturing vitals</p><p>lab tests if required</p><p>consultation after tests</p><p>drug orders</p><p>There are different flows for Emergency, IPD, only lab visits etc.</p><h2>Domain Model and Terminology</h2><p>Patient / Person</p><p>Provider - doctor, nurse, lab technician, radiologist, cashier, dispenser, registration guy</p><p>Visit</p><p>Encounter</p><p>Observation</p><p>Orders</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
